§ `Section 207.1 -- international cruise ships`

-- (4) "international cruise ship means a passenger ship that is suitable for continuous ocean voyages of at least forty-eight hours duration, but does not include such a ship that is used or fitted for the primary purpose of transporting cargo or vehicles"
#ASSERT `s 207.1(4) international cruise ship` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 207.1(4) international cruise ship` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 207.1(4) international cruise ship` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 207.1(4) international cruise ship` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
